1
00:01:35,520 --> 00:01:36,160
Are you hurt?

2
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:37,040
Is it serious?

3
00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:37,920
What did the doctor say?

4
00:01:38,520 --> 00:01:39,000
I'm fine.

5
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:39,920
How are you?

6
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:41,880
Why did Lu Xu suddenly go crazy today?

7
00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:43,720
I don't know.

8
00:01:44,120 --> 00:01:45,520
I remember drinking water in the restaurant.

9
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:47,200
When I woke up, I was in Lu Xu's bed.

10
00:01:52,960 --> 00:01:54,280
Are you his family?

11
00:01:54,440 --> 00:01:55,600
His life was saved.

12
00:01:55,840 --> 00:01:57,840
But he has Rh-negative blood,

13
00:01:58,040 --> 00:01:58,640
so we need to

14
00:01:58,800 --> 00:01:59,920
get blood from the blood bank.

15
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,000
And he

16
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,240
has multiple fractures

17
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:03,800
and severe concussion.

18
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:05,400
So he needs to be observed in ICU.

19
00:02:05,760 --> 00:02:06,640
We can't estimate

20
00:02:07,080 --> 00:02:08,040
when he will wake up.

21
00:02:16,200 --> 00:02:17,160
I'll tell the Old Madam.

22
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:22,480
Tell everyone present today.

23
00:02:22,760 --> 00:02:24,320
Whoever dares to tell my mother

24
00:02:24,880 --> 00:02:25,520
will be put

25
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:27,160
in the ICU with Lu Xu.

26
00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:28,000
Understand?

27
00:02:28,960 --> 00:02:29,440
Yes.

28
00:02:50,680 --> 00:02:52,320
I heard you got scratched by Lu Xu

29
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:54,120
while saving me.

30
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:58,200
What a pity.

31
00:02:58,960 --> 00:02:59,920
It's on your face.

32
00:03:02,480 --> 00:03:03,360
It doesn't matter.

33
00:03:11,640 --> 00:03:12,720
Where are you going?

34
00:03:13,720 --> 00:03:14,560
To get some air.

35
00:03:14,720 --> 00:03:15,480
Jiang Li.

36
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:18,720
Today,

37
00:03:20,720 --> 00:03:21,560
thank you.

38
00:03:46,760 --> 00:03:48,280
[Hatred is blind.]

39
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:50,880
[Anger can make people lose their minds.]

40
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:53,200
[31.8 yuan has been paid.]

41
00:03:54,920 --> 00:03:55,840
[Revenge]

42
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:59,480
[is meant to be the most beautiful tribute to the victim,]

43
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:03,400
[but it often burns itself up as well.]

44
00:04:05,320 --> 00:04:07,720
I know that to gracefully exit the world's living room,

45
00:04:09,200 --> 00:04:11,120
one must bow and depart.

46
00:04:12,480 --> 00:04:13,880
But at this moment,

47
00:04:14,480 --> 00:04:16,000
I have completely lost all means of retreat.

48
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,680
I live by revenge,

49
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:22,040
yet I am also being consumed by hatred.

50
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:26,560
I am prepared to endure the scorching flames of hell.

51
00:04:28,400 --> 00:04:29,920
Because human justice

52
00:04:30,280 --> 00:04:32,280
is nothing more than a clumsy imitation.

53
00:04:34,960 --> 00:04:35,880
And I

54
00:04:37,520 --> 00:04:39,400
will make it perfect.

55
00:05:54,440 --> 00:05:55,400
Wounds in the rain

56
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:57,080
will get infected and scarred.

57
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:41,840
It might hurt a bit.

58
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:44,200
Bear with it for a while.

59
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:51,280
Does it hurt?

60
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:04,640
Go change your clothes.

61
00:07:17,400 --> 00:07:18,200
Shen Jingmo,

62
00:07:19,960 --> 00:07:22,560
when I saw Lu Xu lying in a pool of blood today,

63
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:27,160
I was actually laughing.

64
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:31,280
Do you think I'm a devil

65
00:07:33,160 --> 00:07:34,320
or a good person?

66
00:07:35,280 --> 00:07:37,040
It depends on whose perspective.

67
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:40,120
In my eyes,

68
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:42,280
you are a good person.

69
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:44,480
Thank you.

70
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:52,320
Do you still think I'm a good person now?

71
00:08:59,920 --> 00:09:01,320
I said

72
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:03,640
those people

73
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:06,080
don't deserve you to stain your hands.

74
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:12,360
Even if you really take me as a stepping stone,

75
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:17,800
I'm also willing to do it.

76
00:09:24,280 --> 00:09:27,080
If the place you're going to is endless darkness,

77
00:09:29,760 --> 00:09:30,520
I'm willing to accompany you

78
00:09:31,080 --> 00:09:32,560
to the endless darkness.

79
00:09:32,920 --> 00:09:33,880
But we just...

80
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:24,520
Jenny, what are you going to do?

81
00:10:25,520 --> 00:10:26,200
Ah.

82
00:10:28,680 --> 00:10:29,720
Don't struggle anymore.

83
00:10:29,720 --> 00:10:30,960
This is a water-soluble tie.

84
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:32,160
If it falls into the river,

85
00:10:32,160 --> 00:10:34,120
it will dissolve naturally in two hours.

86
00:10:34,440 --> 00:10:34,680
Jenny,

87
00:10:34,680 --> 00:10:35,640
Are you crazy?

88
00:10:35,920 --> 00:10:36,400
Crazy?

89
00:10:36,640 --> 00:10:37,600
I am crazy.

90
00:10:37,600 --> 00:10:39,200
And you made me crazy.

91
00:10:39,600 --> 00:10:41,720
Since I accidentally got that file,

92
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:43,920
I have become a pawn on your chessboard.

93
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:47,080
You are sure that I dare not confront Annie,

94
00:10:47,560 --> 00:10:49,960
and can only present the evidence to the Young Master.

95
00:10:50,720 --> 00:10:53,560
And all of this was carefully planned by you.

96
00:10:54,120 --> 00:10:56,440
You drugged Lu Qianqian's water in advance.

97
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:59,440
Props, sets, and actors.

98
00:10:59,880 --> 00:11:02,280
You're really a thoughtful director.

99
00:11:03,360 --> 00:11:05,360
Then you just wait for the Young Master to see the materials

100
00:11:05,520 --> 00:11:06,960
and impulsively confront you,

101
00:11:07,760 --> 00:11:08,800
falling into your trap,

102
00:11:08,960 --> 00:11:10,960
and killing the Lu family through me.

103
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:12,400
You're really something, Jiang Li.

104
00:11:12,560 --> 00:11:14,160
When you do what I want,

105
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:15,560
you will also get

106
00:11:16,640 --> 00:11:18,240
what you want.

107
00:11:19,400 --> 00:11:20,600
Now,

108
00:11:21,040 --> 00:11:24,320
it's my turn to set the rules of the game.

109
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:33,280
You...

110
00:11:38,120 --> 00:11:38,920
Ah.

111
00:11:46,800 --> 00:11:47,720
You're really a devil.

112
00:11:48,520 --> 00:11:50,480
You even used the bitter scheme.

113
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:53,200
You planned to anger Zhou Jian

114
00:11:53,440 --> 00:11:55,960
and let him vent his resentment accumulated over the years

115
00:11:56,240 --> 00:11:57,480
to cripple the Young Master.

116
00:11:58,240 --> 00:12:00,280
If he does anything to hurt me,

117
00:12:00,640 --> 00:12:01,760
will you protect me?

118
00:12:01,880 --> 00:12:04,240
But a car accident almost killed him.

119
00:12:04,360 --> 00:12:06,080
Maybe that's more to your liking.

120
00:12:06,160 --> 00:12:07,800
After all, he is in the ICU,

121
00:12:07,960 --> 00:12:10,160
so he can't expose your true colors.

122
00:12:10,280 --> 00:12:13,280
Your revenge is not just for your sister.

123
00:12:13,520 --> 00:12:16,680
Your target is not just Zhou Jian and Lu Qianqian.

124
00:12:17,760 --> 00:12:19,040
20 years ago,

125
00:12:19,040 --> 00:12:21,680
Your parents died in the Su family's factory fire.

126
00:12:22,120 --> 00:12:22,960
And now,

127
00:12:23,360 --> 00:12:25,200
you want the entire Lu family to be buried with them.

128
00:12:27,200 --> 00:12:27,920
Jenny,

129
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:30,240
do you believe in karma?

130
00:12:32,560 --> 00:12:33,520
I do.

131
00:12:34,960 --> 00:12:38,200
That's why I'll pay with my life.

132
00:12:39,680 --> 00:12:41,360
If you kill me today,

133
00:12:42,080 --> 00:12:43,320
it's also the cause and effect.

134
00:12:44,680 --> 00:12:46,880
Are you willing to take the consequences?

135
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:20,560
How's it going?

136
00:13:20,680 --> 00:13:21,360
Have you found her?

137
00:13:21,880 --> 00:13:23,280
We haven't found Jiang Li yet.

138
00:13:23,560 --> 00:13:24,160
There's no one at home,

139
00:13:24,160 --> 00:13:25,200
and her phone is off.

140
00:13:26,960 --> 00:13:27,800
I see.

141
00:13:28,360 --> 00:13:29,600
Let me know as soon as you have any updates.

142
00:13:29,800 --> 00:13:30,160
Okay.

143
00:13:34,320 --> 00:13:35,920
It's no use drinking here.

144
00:13:36,400 --> 00:13:38,080
Maybe she just wants to be alone.

145
00:13:38,760 --> 00:13:40,120
She'll be back soon.

146
00:13:40,240 --> 00:13:42,000
Jiang Li has been missing for 36 hours.

147
00:13:43,640 --> 00:13:45,400
There are 48 hours left until the press conference.

148
00:14:00,560 --> 00:14:01,160
What's wrong?

149
00:14:06,040 --> 00:14:07,040
My mom...

150
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:09,680
She's coming back.

151
00:14:25,080 --> 00:14:26,040
It's time to take a bow.

152
00:14:26,320 --> 00:14:27,520
My Black Queen,

153
00:14:27,960 --> 00:14:29,520
the princess from the fairy tale,

154
00:14:29,640 --> 00:14:31,440
is about to make a dazzling entrance.

155
00:14:37,920 --> 00:14:38,400
Hello.

156
00:14:38,800 --> 00:14:39,320
Hello.

157
00:14:39,800 --> 00:14:40,440
Congratulations.

158
00:14:40,760 --> 00:14:41,560
Hello.

159
00:14:49,240 --> 00:14:50,200
Dear.

160
00:14:50,680 --> 00:14:51,360
Oh my.

161
00:14:51,560 --> 00:14:52,960
Long time no see.

162
00:14:52,960 --> 00:14:54,080
You look stunning today.

163
00:14:54,320 --> 00:14:55,400
Go inside.

164
00:14:55,400 --> 00:14:56,120
Okay.

165
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:03,360
Hello?

166
00:15:03,360 --> 00:15:04,160
This is...

167
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:15,080
What's wrong, honey?

168
00:15:15,400 --> 00:15:16,360
The guests are almost all here.

169
00:15:16,560 --> 00:15:17,520
Why don't you get changed?

170
00:15:20,240 --> 00:15:21,520
It's the police.

171
00:15:21,600 --> 00:15:23,840
They found Jiang Li's car in the wild.

172
00:15:26,920 --> 00:15:28,080
She might be in trouble.

173
00:15:28,320 --> 00:15:29,320
I'll be right back.

174
00:15:29,480 --> 00:15:31,200
[People who worship money]

175
00:15:31,840 --> 00:15:33,560
[will eventually become hungry wolves.]

176
00:15:35,320 --> 00:15:36,600
It would be better if she were dead.

177
00:15:36,920 --> 00:15:39,240
[When they greedily devour their own kind,]

178
00:15:40,120 --> 00:15:43,440
[they forget they were once humans who walked on two legs.]

179
00:15:44,720 --> 00:15:46,680
[The brighter the glow of a wealthy family,]

180
00:15:47,960 --> 00:15:49,960
[the deeper the shadow on the other side.]

181
00:15:51,320 --> 00:15:52,520
[But it doesn't matter.]

182
00:15:52,880 --> 00:15:54,600
[I am the darkness that comes to devour]

183
00:15:54,600 --> 00:15:56,640
[those false glows.]

184
00:15:58,560 --> 00:16:01,600
The rose you crowned me with has long withered into thorns.

185
00:16:03,080 --> 00:16:06,040
I planted thorns in the ruins you burned.

186
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:08,000
Tonight,

187
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:10,240
they will climb your sturdy castle

188
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:15,000
and carve your testimony of sins on every brick.

189
00:16:16,800 --> 00:16:17,840
The trending topic is blowing up.

190
00:16:17,960 --> 00:16:20,120
The rich in-law cheated on his brother's fiancée.

191
00:16:20,120 --> 00:16:22,440
Even TV dramas wouldn't dare to film such a plot.

192
00:16:22,720 --> 00:16:24,000
But the Golden Silk Group's

193
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:26,720
Dark Fairy Tale Series Fashion Show is approaching.

194
00:16:26,800 --> 00:16:30,280
But the Lu Family exposed a shocking scandal.

195
00:16:33,800 --> 00:16:35,240
Look, Lu Qianqian is coming out.

196
00:16:35,320 --> 00:16:35,760
Mr. Lu.

197
00:16:35,760 --> 00:16:36,760
Hasn't Jiang Li disappeared?

198
00:16:36,760 --> 00:16:37,800
How could she appear again?

199
00:16:37,840 --> 00:16:41,080
Is this the first time you've learned about your husband's infidelity?

200
00:16:41,120 --> 00:16:43,240
Does Annie know about this?

201
00:16:43,240 --> 00:16:45,320
Will this affect the company's listing?

202
00:16:45,320 --> 00:16:46,560
When will Annie come back?

203
00:16:46,640 --> 00:16:48,200
Mr. Lu.

204
00:17:01,080 --> 00:17:03,400
The live streaming room has reached a climax at this moment.

205
00:17:03,960 --> 00:17:06,800
Now, a guest is about to appear.

206
00:17:07,640 --> 00:17:09,120
Who do you think it will be?

207
00:17:13,360 --> 00:17:14,120
That's right.

208
00:17:14,560 --> 00:17:16,120
It's our female lead,

209
00:17:16,760 --> 00:17:18,080
Miss Lu,

210
00:17:18,320 --> 00:17:19,480
Lu Qianqian.

211
00:17:31,320 --> 00:17:32,440
It's you?

212
00:17:37,520 --> 00:17:38,480
Where's Jiang Li?

213
00:17:38,880 --> 00:17:39,800
Where is she?
